{
  "name": "in-bank-codes",
  "title": "Indian bank code",
  "source": "razorpay/ifsc, src/banknames.json at commit 85c030965298e81d6725f72cf57238daedbbb36d (committed 1 Sep 2026): its keys, the bank codes. https://github.com/razorpay/ifsc/blob/85c030965298e81d6725f72cf57238daedbbb36d/src/banknames.json. The project's README names RBI's lists of NEFT and RTGS IFSCs as the sources it uses, and NPCI's lists among others. RBI's own list, https://www.rbi.org.in/Scripts/bs_viewcontent.aspx?Id=2009 (updated as on 15 Nov 2026), is one Excel file per bank, which RBI's server answers with a bot check.",
